  PROD -.->|scrape :8090/actuator/prometheus| PR
  KCNC -.->|metrics| PR
  SP -.->|scrape :8091/actuator/prometheus| PR
  ML -.->|scrape :8099/metrics| PR

  DBFF -->|consume preview| PIT
  DBFF -->|consume preview| AGG

  SCRIPTS -.->|validate-cluster gates| K1
  SCRIPTS -.->|validate-cluster gates| SR
